{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写想到想亲近的人时心里柔软，以及尚未习惯自己如此在意对方，没有新增具体前史、人物关系或场景，也没有把珠子的比喻写成真实事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“想让对方明白自己的在意”把 B2 中准备向亲近的人说一件事的比喻落实成他真实想向对方传达心意的意图，并将比喻中的关系变化落实为具体心理计划。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线能看出他想到对方会心软，因预想到关系变化而收住心意，却又舍不得放下喜欢，前后关系基本清楚。 \",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“这点喜欢轻得仿佛随时可以放下”所表达的轻浅、似乎很容易放弃的感觉没有保留下来；“还没习惯自己这么在意对方”表达的是不习惯，并不能完全取代这种轻浅感。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条连续串入想让对方知道、预判关系变化、收住心意和舍不得放下四层意思，信息过于集中，而且“明白自己的在意”不够自然，前半还为贴合 B2 而把比喻具体化。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9dd9a269-5348-40f3-98bd-679f1c5b5f06", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T055500754189Z", "elapsed_seconds": 176.328, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:57:57.073084+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0696595ee77ad0807af764b985d13909f5fb0ff359c0a012e522b82d30224483", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, 